d style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Otherwise RD is the result</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">47</td><td class=\"c\">C3E</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO 3E</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">&bdquo;E2&ldquo;</td><td class=\"a\">48</td><td class=\"c\">0D2</td><td class=\"m\">MOV D,2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td rowspan=\"2\">RD is the result (pile 2)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">49</td><td class=\"c\">C3E</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO 3E</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">&bdquo;E3&ldquo;</td><td class=\"a\">4A</td><td class=\"c\">918</td><td class=\"m\">CMPI 1,8</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td>Skill level 1?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">4B</td><td class=\"c\">E35</td><td class=\"m\">BRZ 35</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">&bdquo;-1&ldquo;</td><td>Yes, then default move (&bdquo;-1&ldquo;)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">4C</td><td class=\"c\">0D1</td><td class=\"m\">MOV D,1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Otherwise reg. D is the result (pile 3)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">4D</td><td class=\"c\">C3E</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO 3E</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr></table>"
